{"parse": {"title": "Devil Star", "pageid": 2209, "revid": 11840, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Devil Stars</b> are capsules from <b>Update 9</b> that grant the player a <b>random mythic unit</b> from Update 9 and can be obtained in 2 ways:\n</p>\n<ul><li>From <b>Devil Contracts</b>, with the higher the difficulty the higher chance to receive a Devil Star.</li>\n<li>Can be purchased from Makimo for 1000 Bullets</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Mythics\">Obtainable Mythics</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Akin\" title=\"Akin\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dd/Unknown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20220907122740\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Unknown.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Akin</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kobeno\" title=\"Kobeno\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dd/Unknown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20220907122740\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Unknown.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Kobeno</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hime\" title=\"Hime\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dd/Unknown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20220907122740\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Unknown.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Hime</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Unknown.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dd/Unknown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20220907122740\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Angel</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Power\" title=\"Power\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Unknown.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dd/Unknown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20220907122740\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Power</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chainsaw\" title=\"Chainsaw\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Unknown.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dd/Unknown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20220907122740\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Chainsaw</div></dd>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>Most of these characters introduced new mechanics to the game as:\n</p><ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Angel (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW5nZWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Angel</span> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Angel (Devil) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW5nZWxfKERldmlsKT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Angel (Devil)</span> using base hp to attack,</li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Akin (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWtpbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Akin</span> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Akin (Contract) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWtpbl8oQ29udHJhY3QpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Akin (Contract)</span> having two attack modes that could be switched,</li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Power (Fiend) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUG93ZXJfKEZpZW5kKT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Power (Fiend)</span> having a bleed amplification debuff to make enemies take more bleed damage,</li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Hime (Ghost) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGltZV8oR2hvc3QpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Hime (Ghost)</span> both attacking itself, and being able to summon a creature with its ability.</li></ul>\n</blockquote><blockquote>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021154928\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.111 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.129 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 502/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8501/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 6/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.055/7.000 seconds\nLua mem